Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|XSS|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Validate XSS Vulnerabilities
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And these variables
		|maliciousURL1||
	And these variables
		|maliciousURL2||
	And these variables
		|maliciousURL3||
	And these variables
		|maliciousURL4||
	And Open at locator '${maliciousURL1}'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Not Found' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_ALERT_ERROR'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'The requested resource could not be found.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'Home#URL_ERROR_MESSAGE'
	And Open at locator '${maliciousURL2}'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Not Found' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_ALERT_ERROR'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'The requested resource could not be found.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'Home#URL_ERROR_MESSAGE'
	And Open at locator '${maliciousURL3}'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Not Found' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_ALERT_ERROR'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'The requested resource could not be found.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND'
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'Home#URL_ERROR_MESSAGE'
	And Open at locator '${maliciousURL4}'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Not Found' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_ALERT_ERROR'
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'The requested resource could not be found.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND'
	Then AssertElementPresent at locator 'Home#URL_ERROR_MESSAGE'
Scenario: View Bookmark No XSS
Priority: 4
	Given Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	When User edit Details Via My Account
		|userLastNameEdit||
	And Navigator open URL
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Bookmarks|
	And Navigator open URL
	And RelatedAssets goto Bookmarks Selection PG
		|assetType|Bookmarks Entry|
	And Bookmark add Related Asset Bookmarks Entry PG
		|bookmarkName|Test Bookmark Name|
		|bookmarkURL|http://www.liferay.com|
	Then AssertAlertNotPresent
Scenario: View Control Panel No XSS
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these variables
		|siteName||
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Type the value '${siteName}' at locator 'NavBar#BASIC_SEARCH_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'Icon#BASIC_SEARCH'
	And these variables
		|key_rowEntry|${siteName}|
	And AssertClick the value '${siteName}' at locator 'ContentRow#ENTRY_CONTENT_ENTRY_NAME_LINK'
	And AssertAlertNotPresent
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Public Pages' at locator 'Portlet#HEADER'
	And these variables
		|key_siteName|${siteName}|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value '${siteName}' at locator 'ProductMenu#PRODUCT_MENU_PANEL_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_SITE_NAME'
