Scenario: View Recycle Bin No XSS
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these variables
		|entryTitle||
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And Type type Ace Editor the value '${entryTitle}' at locator 'AlloyEditor#TITLE_FIELD'
	And BlogsEntry add Content
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And Portlet change Display Style
		|displayStyle|Descriptive|
	And BlogsEntry move To Recycle Bin CP
		|assetType|Blogs Entry|
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|${entryTitle}|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Recycle Bin|
	And RecycleBin restore CP
		|assetName|${entryTitle}|
		|assetRestoreLocation|Blogs|
		|assetType|Blogs Entry|
	Then AssertAlertNotPresent
